<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia December palm oil export duties.</title>
<headline>Malaysia December palm oil export duties.</headline>
<text>
<p>(All quoted in ringgit/tonne)</p>
<p>Products		     Value		   Duty</p>
<p>				December(November)   December(November)</p>
<p>Crude Palm Oil	    1,231.93 (1,167.89)   149.58 (130.37)</p>
<p>Processed Palm Oil	1,323.18 (1,325.75)   176.95 (177.72)</p>
<p>Palm Kernel Oil	     949.30 (957.55)     189.87 (191.52)</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230-8911)</p>
